    bigPicture: "This is the architecture decision at the heart of applied AI. It connects **RAG** and **embeddings**/**vector databases** (the retrieval path) with **training-vs-inference** (why fine-tuning is costly training work while RAG is cheap inference work) and **prompt engineering** (the free first option). Get this right and the rest of the AI feature — cost, freshness, accuracy — falls into place.",
